		{
			description: ["In your pursuit of the Creators' secrets, you've discovered ancient texts speaking of a mystical art that binds essence to soil. The first whispers of this knowledge are contained within these pages. With this power, you may cultivate resources once thought unmalleable - perhaps even elements of the Creators' own designs."]
